Output docs/demos/sessions.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 19
Set Width 1050
Set Height 600
Set Padding 20
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 35ms
Set WindowBar Colorful
Hide
Type "go build -o bin/muse-demo ./examples/demo"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Type "clear"
Enter
Show
Type "./bin/muse-demo -demo sessions"
Enter
Sleep 5s
Type "./bin/muse-demo -demo resume"
Enter
Sleep 6s
